<p class="eyebrow"><a href="/support/">Support</a> / <a href="/support/voice/">Voice</a> / Calls labeled as potential spam</p>
<h1>Calls labeled as potential spam.</h1>
<p class="lede">Multiple companies provide call analytics, each with their own tracking and scoring systems. The result can be trusted calls that are incorrectly labeled. Here is how to get your numbers reviewed.</p>
<p class="hero-actions">
	<a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://www.freecallerregistry.com/" rel="external">Free Caller Registry</a>
	<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/support/opening-a-ticket/">Open a ticket</a>
</p>

<section class="section-block">
	<h2>1. Let the analytics providers know</h2>
	<p>The analytics companies score calls on behalf of the carriers, so one review request can reach several carriers at once.</p>
	<div class="alert alert-info" role="note">
		<p><strong>Start with the <a href="https://www.freecallerregistry.com/" rel="external">Free Caller Registry</a>.</strong> This free portal reaches First Orion, Hiya, and TNS, the analytics companies that support the major wireless carriers in the US.</p>
		<p>The analytics companies review each request and may still label calls depending on their own analytics or research.</p>
	</div>
	<p>To reach one analytics company directly:</p>
	<ul class="features-grid">
		<li class="feature">
			<span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "search" %}</span>
			<h3><a href="https://www.calltransparency.com/" rel="external">Call Transparency</a></h3>
			<p>First Orion. Used for <strong>T-Mobile</strong>. Supports bulk reporting.</p>
		</li>
		<li class="feature">
			<span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "shield-check" %}</span>
			<h3><a href="https://www.hiya.com/manageyourcallerid" rel="external">Hiya</a></h3>
			<p>Used for <strong>AT&amp;T</strong>.</p>
		</li>
		<li class="feature">
			<span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "broadcast-pin" %}</span>
			<h3><a href="https://www.reportarobocall.com/trf/" rel="external">TNS</a></h3>
			<p>Used for <strong>Verizon</strong>, <strong>Comcast</strong>, <strong>Spectrum</strong>, and others.</p>
		</li>
		<li class="feature">
			<span class="feature-icon" aria-hidden="true">{% icon "headset" %}</span>
			<h3><a href="https://www.home.neustar/support" rel="external">Neustar</a></h3>
			<p>Use the contact information listed under Communications, Robocall Mitigation.</p>
		</li>
	</ul>
</section>

