<section class="section-block">
	<h2>What VoiceTel can do</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>VoiceTel continues to work with the industry, through our participation in associations, directly with the carriers, and in partnership with customers, to help resolve false labeling while still working toward flagging and stopping illegal spoofing and robocalling.</li>
		<li>By design, from the carrier requirements placed on their analytics providers, we as the number provider are limited in our ability to clear potential spam labels. The carriers and analytics companies have pushed registration, such as the Free Caller Registry, to the end user.</li>
		<li>If the first two options are unsuccessful, open a ticket with our NOC and we will provide any help we are able to. Include the affected numbers, the label the called party saw, and the called party's carrier.</li>
	</ul>
</section>

